      47.85,
      382.09,
      539.87,
      417.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 28(a) read with Section 16(c) of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) as amendedfrom time to time, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Notification order that all arrack and beer manufacturersshould pay a minimum excise duty of Rs. 200 million per month.",
