      430.09,
      539.94,
      465.16
    ],
    "text": "02. Liquor Manufacturing Licenses of all arrack and beer manufacturers who shall not fulfill the above condition withrespect to a certain month shall be cancelled with effect from the 01st of the subsequent month. This procedure shall be in effectfrom 01.04.2015.",
